; Like beancount's boolean options, infer_tolerance_from_cost is on for
; "true" and "on" in any case and for "1". On, the price widens the USD
; tolerance, so -576.11252 USD keeps its five digits; off, it would be
; rounded to -576.1125 USD.
option "infer_tolerance_from_cost" "on"

